+# Phase 08.9 — Owner acceptance corrections
+Base: a794d769f0ff2fafe035818f98367ba42b09fac6
+Owner accepted Wishlist transfer and Free/Premium toggle. Corrections: visible optional Discover player stepper; Featured Games (curated, not popularity); one mock Free banner in shared shell except internal/login/invite; remove displayed game Vibe scores but retain seven-dimension profile and Premium targets. Wizard Next commits displayed default count after previously skipped count.
+Initial browser run passed Free and Premium banner checks on 11 routes each, Discover count and Featured Games, profile, Surprise Me, hard limits, no-repeat reroll and exact-score target. Score persisted and correct winner displayed; test assertion failed due to capitalization (WINS), corrected for rerun. Recently Played end-to-end check pending at packaging unless subsequent result recorded. No scanner engine changes, live ads, provider calls, telemetry, or production deployment. Repeat full regression (452 inventory; 441 standard + 11 PostgreSQL) and production build before final acceptance.
